                "summaryZh": "《集量论》把现量界定为离分别，说明名称、种类和概念附加已经属于后续构造，而非直接感知本身。",
                "source": {
                  "workId": "dignaga-pramanasamuccaya",
                  "locator": "Pramanasamuccaya, perception as free from conceptual construction",
                  "excerptStatus": "summary_only"
